#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:5
msgid "Edit summary"
msgstr "编辑摘要"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:7
msgid ""
"The summary properties can only be displayed from `selection properties "
"panel`_ once the summary table has been selected at `workspace`_."
msgstr ""
"摘要属性只能从 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_ 在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ "
"选中摘要表后显示。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:13
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech summary properties panel, display tab"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 摘要属性面板，显示标签"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:17
msgid ""
"If the `selection properties panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed "
"from **Settings > Display > Selection properties**."
msgstr ""
"如果不显示 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 选择属性** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:20
msgid "Summary geometry and line"
msgstr "简略几何和线条"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:25
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech summary geometry and lines properties"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech摘要几何和线条属性"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:27
msgid ""
"The **Geometry and lines** section from the summary properties allows "
"defining:"
msgstr "**图形和线条** 部分从摘要属性中可以定义："

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:29
msgid "Summary table position (coordinates **X** and **Y**) in the `folio`_."
msgstr "简表位置(坐标 **X** 和 **Y**)在 `图幅 <folio_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:30
msgid "Maximum number of table rows."
msgstr "最大表行数 。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:31
msgid ""
"Adjust the size of the table to the `folio`_, automatic margin definition."
msgstr "将表格的大小调整到 `图幅 <folio_>`_，自动比值定义。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:32
msgid ""
"Define previous summary table, property to be used if the number of "
"`folios`_ is higher than the maximum number of rows defined."
msgstr "定义上一个简表，如果 `图幅 <folios_>`_ 的编号高于定义的最大行数，则使用属性。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:36
msgid ""
"If the number of `folios`_ is higher than the maximum number of rows "
"defined, each summary table has to have a **Table name** defined. Without "
"**Table name**, the link between tables cannot be defined."
msgstr ""
"如果 `图幅 <folios_>`_ 的数字高于定义的最大行数，则每个总表必须有一个 **表名称** 的定义。没有 "
"**表名称**,表格之间的链接无法定义。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:41
msgid "Header"
msgstr "页眉"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:46
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech summary header properties"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 摘要标题属性"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:48
msgid "The **Header** section from the summary properties allows defining:"
msgstr "**头** 部分来自摘要属性，允许定义："

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:50
msgid "Top, bottom, left and right margin in the header cells."
msgstr "头部单元格的上，下，左右边距。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:51
msgid "Text alignment in the header cells."
msgstr "标题单元格中的文本对齐。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:52
msgid "Text font of the table header."
msgstr "表格头的文字字体。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:57
#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:76
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech summary table text font"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech简表文字字体"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:60
msgid "Table"
msgstr "图表"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:65
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech summary table properties panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech简表属性面板"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:67
msgid "The **Table** section from the summary properties allows defining:"
msgstr "汇总属性中的 **表** 部分允许定义："

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:69
msgid "Top, bottom, left and right margin in the table cells."
msgstr "表格单元格的上，下，左右边距。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:70
msgid "Text alignment in the table cells."
msgstr "表格单元格中的文本对齐。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:71
msgid "Text font of the table."
msgstr "表格的文字字体。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:79
msgid "Content request"
msgstr "内容请求"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:81
msgid ""
"The `folio properties`_ to be displayed at the summary tables, the columns "
"information, can be modified and re-organized at any time."
msgstr "`组合属性 <folio properties_>`_ 要显示在简表，列信息，可以随时修改和重新组织。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:84
msgid "To modify the content request form the summary:"
msgstr "修改内容请求构成摘要："

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:86
msgid ""
"`Select`_ one of the tables from the summary to display the summary "
"properties at `selection properties panel`_."
msgstr ""
"`从摘要中选择 <Select_>`_，在 `选择属性面板上显示摘要属性 <selection properties panel_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:87
msgid "Go to **Content** tab."
msgstr "转到 **Content** 标签 。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:92
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech summary properties panel, content tab"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 摘要属性面板，内容标签"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:94
msgid ""
"Click **Request** button to display the content configuration PopUp window."
msgstr "点击 **请求** 按钮显示内容配置 PopUp 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:95
msgid "Modify the table content using the following commands:"
msgstr "使用下列命令修改表格内容："

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:98
msgid "Icon"
msgstr "图标"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:98
msgid "Action"
msgstr "行动"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:98
msgid "Keyboard shortcut"
