msgstr "继续下去"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:103
msgid "Move down this field"
msgstr "下移这个字段"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:109
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech summary properties content request PopUp window"
msgstr "图片：QElectroTech 摘要属性内容请求 PopUp 窗口"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:113
msgid ""
"The content request configuration can be saved and chosen from "
"**Configuration** section to increase working efficiency."
msgstr "内容请求配置可以从 **配置** 部分保存和选择，以提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:115
msgid ""
"QElectroTech is working with SQLite database, summary table content can also"
" be defined by SQL query."
msgstr "QElectroTech正与SQLite数据库合作，总表内容也可以通过SQL查询来定义。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/edit_summary.rst:117
msgid ""
"Once the desired configuration is defined, press **OK** to apply changes."
msgstr "一旦定义了想要的配置，按 **OK** 应用更改。"
